From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add selectable permanent event-ticket courier to Littleroot Town

Reference: pret/pokeemerald @ 5eff78649e7170a877b961ef0b3da13b81a16038

Add a new always-present event courier near Professor Birch's Lab. The
courier presents exactly four choices: Eon Ticket, Mystic Ticket, Aurora
Ticket, and Old Sea Map. One item is delivered per interaction. Pressing B
cancels without receiving anything.

Existing Pokemon Center Mystery Gift behavior, S.S. Tidal destination logic,
and legendary completion flags remain unchanged.

